tion Evaluation Process\nProgramme & Course Outcome\nResult\nAdvance & Slow Learner\nPublications\nSeminar / Workshop\nStrategic Plan\nNAAC\nNAAC Grading Certificate\nAQAR\nSSR 2024 Documents & Templates\nDVV Documents\nSSR 2024\nIQAC\nIQAC Core Committee\nIQAC Activities\nAnnual Plan & Action Taken Report\nAnnual Reports to DU\nAISHE Reports\nFeedback Forms\nFeedback Analysis\nMeetings\nStudent Satisfaction Survey\nAction Taken Report\nAnnual Report\nStudent Corner\nRoutine\nCultural & Sports Activities\nNCC\nNSS\nAlumni\nProgression & Placement\nVoters Registration\nStudent Union\nNIRF\nRTI\nMore\nBest Practice\nInstitutional Distinctiveness\nExtension Activities\nPhoto Gallery\nGrievane Redressal Cell\nContact Us\nRight to Information\nStatutory Declaration Under Section 4(1) (b) of Right to Information Act – 2005\nDakha Devi Rasiwasia College, Chabua, is a public authority as defined in Section 2(h) and therefore in pursuance of provisions of Section 4 (1) (b) of RTI Act, 2005 hereby makes the following informations available -\nPublic Authority: Dakha Devi Rasiwasia College, Chabua\nList of PIOs:\nA.    Appellate Authority of the College\nDr. Pradip Borah\nPrincipal,\nDakha Devi Rasiwasia College, Chabua\nDibrugarh, Assam -786184\nPh no. 8638713369\nEmail. principaldddrc@gmail.com\nB.    Principal Information Officer of the College\nDr. Debasis Bose\nAssociate Professor, Dept. of Economics\nDakha Devi Rasiwasia College, Chabua\nDibrugarh, Assam -786184\nPh no. 9435130067\nEnail id: rtiddrc@gmail.com\nThe particulars of the organization, functions and duties\nName of the Institution: Dakha Devi Rasiwasia College, Chabua\nFunctions/Services:\nDDR College is a higher education institution having affiliation with Dibrugarh University, Dibrugarh, Assam. The College discharges its functions through the instructions/ circulars issued by (a) The Directorate of Higher Education (b) Dibrugarh University (c) UGC\nDuties:\nDDR  College tries to cater the higher education needs of vast rural and academically , socially and economically challenged students of Chabua.  Providing opportunities to earn degrees and Certificates by thousands of students over the years, it has always focused on the needs of the not so privileged and underprivileged sections of local indigenous communities and tribes.\nProfile of the Institution:\n(a) Affiliated to Dibrugarh University, Dibrugarh (Assam)\n(b) Registered with UGC u/s 2(f) & 12(B)\n(c) NAAC Accreditated “B” Grade in February 2016.\nHead of the institution:\nPrincipal\nDakha Devi Rasiwasia College\nChabua-786184\nDibrugarh District (Assam)\nPhone no:. 03732864559\nEmail: principalddrc@gmail.com\nWebsite: www.ddrcollege.in\nWorking Hours:\nCollege office: 9.00 AM to 5.00 PM,\nClass time: 9.00 AM to 4.00 PM\nHolidays:\nThe College shall remain closed on Sundays and Public Holidays as declared by the Dibrugarh. University/ Government of Assam.\nCourses offered:\nUnder Graduate Programmes\nSl. No.\nName of the Programme leading to Degree\nProgramme Duration\n1\nFYUGP (Major in Assamese, Economics, Education, English, History, Hindi, Political Science, Sociology, Mathematics, Botany, Zoology, Chemistry, Physics, Finance)\n4 years\n2\nB.A. HONOURS (CBCS) Assamese, Economics, Education, English, History, Hindi, Political Science, Sociology, Mathematics, Botany, Zoology, Chemistry, Physics, Finance\n3 years\n3\nB.A. Non-Honours (CBCS)\n3 years\n4\nB.Com Non-Honours (CBCS)\n3 years\nCLICK HERE TO VIEW / DOWNLOAD - THE RIGHT TO INFORMATION ACT, 2005\nHome\nFaculty\nAll Downloads\nView all Notices\nView all Circulars\nContact Us\nDDR College\nP.O Chabua - 786184, Dibrugarh, Assam\nEmail :\nprincipalddrc@gmail.com\nPhone :\n0373-2864559 (O) ::|::\nFax :\n0373-2864559\nddrcollege.in | All Rights Reserve\nPowered By :\nOrbeans", "links": [{"label": "Online Admission", "url": "https://ddrcollege.in/article/kLaBT/onlinePge/onlc.html"}, {"label": "", "url": "https://ddrcollege.in/article/rti/page/qchk.html"}, {"